556	The following monotonicity statement is not a named result of the source
557	article.  It records, as a single inequality, the adjustment of the universal
558	constants of Theorem~\ref{thm:pauli} that is used when the robustness bound is
559	passed from its squared to its unsquared form, and when several estimates are
560	brought to a common scale.
